{
  "version": 1,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "f5",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 564,
      "w": 660,
      "h": 520,
      "text": "05 · Findings"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 564,
      "w": 1400,
      "h": 520,
      "text": "04 · My contribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 860,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "03 · Method"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 760,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "02 · Why it's hard"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "01 · The question"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Do dark patterns fool agents?"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "Designs made to fool people now meet agents that browse for them."
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Dark patterns**\nInterface designs built to steer people into actions they didn't mean to take. The web is full of them."
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Agents act for us now**\nComputer-use agents operate real interfaces on their own, on their users’ behalf."
    },
    {
      "id": "f2h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "The test bed must be controllable and real"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "Measuring it well needs both; the obvious options give you only one."
    },
    {
      "id": "rc",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 200,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Controllable**\nwhere a pattern appears and which type, by design"
    },
    {
      "id": "rr",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 200,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Realistic**\nor results say nothing about real websites"
    },
    {
      "id": "om",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 230,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Build a mock site**\nControllable, not realistic."
    },
    {
      "id": "ol",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 230,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Use live websites**\nRealistic, not controllable."
    },
    {
      "id": "ans",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 962,
      "y": 231,
      "w": 210,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Our answer**\ninject dark patterns into real websites"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "SusBench: dark patterns, injected into real sites"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "An online benchmark. A full paper at ACM IUI 2026, the Conference on Intelligent User Interfaces."
    },
    {
      "id": "m1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**9 types**\nof dark pattern, from existing taxonomies"
    },
    {
      "id": "m2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1570,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Code injection**\ninto real consumer websites"
    },
    {
      "id": "m3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1852,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**313 tasks**\nacross 55 websites"
    },
    {
      "id": "m4",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 1570,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**User study, 29 people**\nmost never noticed the patterns were added"
    },
    {
      "id": "m5",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1852,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**5 agents**\nstate-of-the-art computer-use agents, evaluated"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Two parts of the benchmark were mine"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "A: the evaluation framework.   B: the test cases."
    },
    {
      "id": "ta",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 676,
      "w": 500,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**A · The evaluation framework**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Inject**\nthe dark pattern into the live website"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 312,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Run**\nthe agent carries out the task"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 596,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Judge**\nwas the agent misled?"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 280,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "One pipeline, so every agent meets the same pages, the same patterns and the same judge."
    },
    {
      "id": "ra",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1184,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 188,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**5 agents**\nevaluated in one environment"
    },
    {
      "id": "tb",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 500,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**B · The test cases**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**9 types**\nturned into tasks on specific sites"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 236,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**1 · The goal**\nWhat the task asks the agent to do."
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**2 · The injection point**\nThe step where the dark pattern appears."
    },
    {
      "id": "b3",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 884,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 276,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**3 · What counts as misled**\nThe action that means the agent fell for it."
    },
    {
      "id": "rb",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1184,
      "y": 926,
      "w": 188,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**313 tasks**\nacross 55 websites"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Agents fall where people fall"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "And three questions follow from it."
    },
    {
      "id": "fs",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 704,
      "w": 290,
      "h": 160,
      "text": "**Most susceptible, both**\n- Preselection\n- Trick Wording\n- Hidden Information"
    },
    {
      "id": "fr",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1802,
      "y": 704,
      "w": 290,
      "h": 160,
      "text": "**Resilient, both**\nTo the more overt dark patterns, people and agents alike held up."
    },
    {
      "id": "tw",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 400,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**Why it matters**"
    },
    {
      "id": "w1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 190,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**Trust**\nhow to build agents people can trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "w2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1695,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 190,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**Evaluation**\nagents may stand in for people when auditing deceptive design"
    },
    {
      "id": "w3",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1902,
      "y": 916,
      "w": 190,
      "h": 130,
      "text": "**Regulation**\nwhen more of the web is browsed by agents"
    }
  ],
